@HostAddress = https://localhost:7053
@ApiKey = <paste the same key configured in User Secrets>

### Health — exempt from the API key, this is what the Worker probes before extracting.
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### First page.
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/social-comments?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Oversized pageSize gets clamped to MaxPageSize (1000), not rejected.
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/social-comments?page=1&pageSize=99999
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### No key — expect 401.
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/social-comments?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### page=0 — expect 400.
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/social-comments?page=0
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###
